{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52154","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 十 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缛礼光备，文思可纪。\n日驷轮斜，云门祝止。\n景福垂裕，受厘延祉。\n严训一尊，澄湮万汜。\n（其十。\n《翰林学士集》）（按：本诗原署：「银青光禄大夫中书侍郎行太子右庶子弘文馆学士高阳县开国男臣许敬宗上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}